店的位置，你面前的拉麵就彷彿一道用心、精緻的作品 ✨店內人潮不多也沒有排隊（探店時間是連假的週六中午）\n\n點餐和結帳都是使用機器操作，可以Linepay、載具 💰 蠻方便的～\n🚇 捷運中山站5號出口步行約3分鐘\n\n#台北美食 #中山美食 #拉麵 #日式料理 #捷運美食",null,[0,76]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1115254202044787462/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVPVDFOV2FGUlNXR3hUVW14YWJWa3lPWFZTYkdReVZUSTFVbHBzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1115254202044787462/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVPVDFOV2FGUlNXR3hUVW14YWJWa3lPWFZTYkdReVZUSTFVbHBzUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1115254202044787462/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVPVDFOV2FGUlNXR3hUVW14YWJWa3lPWFZTYkdReVZUSTFVbHBzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1115254202044787462/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVPVDFOV2FGUlNXR3hUVW14YWJWa3lPWFZTYkdReVZUSTFVbHBzUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1115254202044787462/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVPVDFOV2FGUlNXR3hUVW14YWJWa3lPWFZTYkdReVZUSTFVbHBzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1115254202044787462/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVPVDFOV2FGUlNXR3hUVW14YWJWa3lPWFZTYkdReVZUSTFVbHBzUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,7548,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OT1NWaFRSWGxTUmxabVkyOXVSbGQyVTI1UlpsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xe65d8ebc9c1a70c8!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnNOSVhTRXlSRlZmY29uRld2U25RZlE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OT1NWaFRSWGxTUmxabVkyOXVSbGQyVTI1UlpsRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OT1NWaFRSWGxTUmxabVkyOXVSbGQyVTI1UlpsRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OT1NWaFRSWGxTUmxabVkyOXVSbGQyVTI1UlpsRRILMGR4U3NjWTRaRk4aPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09uTk9TVmhUUlhsU1JsWm1ZMjl1UmxkMlUyNVJabEUSCzBkeFNzY1k0WkZOIhIJAAAAAA