dYIVQQ3IcHCMYBKBQ",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["2026/04/11   內附菜單   LinePay🉑   840\n\n龍鱗拉麵整體走的是帶點創意的日式風格，店內氛圍沉穩舒適，用餐環境乾淨，適合想慢慢享受一碗拉麵的時候🍜。服務態度親切，上餐節奏也掌握得不錯。\n\n柚香桂花拉麵風味較為清新，帶有淡淡果香與花香，湯頭不膩但相對記憶點稍弱，屬於耐吃型。豪華叉燒飯份量十足，叉燒軟嫩，但美乃滋比例稍高，吃到後面略顯負擔🥓。唐揚雞外酥內嫩，表現穩定，是安全不踩雷的小點🍗。\n\n整體而言，是一間在風味上有嘗試變化的拉麵店，餐點表現穩定且有特色👍。若能在調味平衡上再細緻一些，整體體驗會更加出色✨。",null,[0,105]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1115254202044787462/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXY1ZOR1JUUlhWVGxDWVZkU1VFOUhkSGRVYkVKYVZFWktTMU5GUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1115254202044787462/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXY1ZOR1JUUlhWVGxDWVZkU1VFOUhkSGRVYkVKYVZFWktTMU5GUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1115254202044787462/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXY1ZOR1JUUlhWVGxDWVZkU1VFOUhkSGRVYkVKYVZFWktTMU5GUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1115254202044787462/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXY1ZOR1JUUlhWVGxDWVZkU1VFOUhkSGRVYkVKYVZFWktTMU5GUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1115254202044787462/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXY1ZOR1JUUlhWVGxDWVZkU1VFOUhkSGRVYkVKYVZFWktTMU5GUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1115254202044787462/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXY1ZOR1JUUlhWVGxDWVZkU1VFOUhkSGRVYkVKYVZFWktTMU5GUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,1717,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WcVNGRTRXVTlCYVdSUE9HdHdUbEJaVEZKS1NFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xe65d8ebc9c1a70c8!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnVqSFE4WU9BaWRPOGtwTlBZTFJKSEE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WcVNGRTRXVTlCYVdSUE9HdHdUbEJaVEZKS1NFRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQ