ort?postId\u003d!1e10!2sCIABIhDx2DdaZ__KMErWQXWomgNl\u0026t\u003d27\u0026cb_client\u003dmaps_sv.tactile\u0026fid\u003d0x0:0xe65d8ebc9c1a70c8"]],1,null,null,null,null,null,null,["0","-1847163331428060984"],null,null,[null,1],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Sa2F6UTRUbHBhYW1ndE9XNWthMGxwVUdsQ1gxRRAB"]],"CIABIhDx2DdaZ__KMErWQXWomgNl",1]],null,null,null,[[["GUIDED_DINING_MEAL_TYPE"],"用餐類型為何？",[[[["E:LUNCH"],"午餐",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjxj9rz8dSWAxUee_UHHfdYIVQQ3YcHCIICKAA"]],1],null,null,"餐點類型",null,"0ahUKEwjxj9rz8dSWAxUee_UHHfdYIVQQ3IcHCIECKAg",null,null,null,null,null,1,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PRICE_RANGE"],"每個人平均花費多少？",[[[["E:TWD_200_TO_400"],"$200-400",2,null,"$200 到 $400","0ahUKEwjxj9rz8dSWAxUee_UHHfdYIVQQ3YcHCIQCKAA"]],1],null,null,"平均每人消費金額",null,"0ahUKEwjxj9rz8dSWAxUee_UHHfdYIVQQ3IcHCIMCKAk",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2],[["GUIDED_DINING_FOOD_ASPECT"],"餐點",null,null,null,"餐點",null,"0ahUKEwjxj9rz8dSWAxUee_UHHfdYIVQQ3IcHCIUCKAo",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwjxj9rz8dSWAxUee_UHHfdYIVQQ3IcHCIYCKAs",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjxj9rz8dSWAxUee_UHHfdYIVQQ3IcHCIcCKAw",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_UP_TO_10_MIN"],"最多 10 分鐘",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjxj9rz8dSWAxUee_UHHfdYIVQQ3YcHCIkCKAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwjxj9rz8dSWAxUee_UHHfdYIVQQ3IcHCIgCKA0",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_SEATING_TYPE"],"可選擇哪些類型的座位？",null,[[[["E:DINING_SEATING_TYPE_INDOOR_DINING_AREA"],"室內用餐區",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjxj9rz8dSWAxUee_UHHfdYIVQQ3YcHCIsCKAA"]]],null,"座位類型",null,"0ahUKEwjxj9rz8dSWAxUee_UHHfdYIVQQ3IcHCIoCKA4",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["20260322[二刷]\n本次評價『美味』👍👍\n\n[豪蝦肉盛拉麵] 400\n湯頭就是濃濃的蝦味，配上兩隻巨蝦(殼都撥好了歐)，蠻不錯的。豚骨肉片和舒肥雞也很鮮甜，搭配著濃湯也很不錯。最後來顆糖心蛋就是一碗不錯的拉麵了~\n\n[豪華叉燒飯] 320\n一般叉燒飯的大小，上面鋪滿鮭魚卵和一顆干貝，看起來很享受，但是吃到最後味道會很鹹很重，干貝倒是不錯好吃。\n\n_____________心得文______________\n最近要忙著各式各樣的事情到處奔波，要開始忙著找工作。在空閒時間理趕緊出來吃一波。\n吃著吃著發現前面有一罐很像是胡椒粉的調味料，結果加了一點喝下去時差點噴出來，原來是胡椒粉(我死了....)。我下次不亂加了嗚嗚~\n\n20260228 [首刷]\n本次評價『美味』👍👍\n[豚骨魚介肉盛] 360\n濃郁的豚骨加上魚肉熬煮的湯頭，味道挺不錯的，配上洋蔥和蔥花很入味。而且豚骨肉片Q彈美味、另一個雞肉則是軟嫩並且還蘊含著魚味，頗為新奇。\n麵量中等，配一顆糖心蛋，也好吃。\n[叉燒飯] 70\n這碗叉燒飯，不僅叉燒大塊分量多，烤美乃滋也是又香又甜，白飯淋上的醬汁也是剛剛好不鹹不甘，推薦~\n_____________心得文______________\n要來這家店之前，我被另一家在附近的拉麵店給搞錯了，差點以為要排號碼到下午兩點去(傻眼)，但最終看一下地圖發現位置不對才發現走錯店家了XD。\n這家拉麵店氣氛不錯，人也不多(lucky)，就是價格很高，但是在中山站附近來說算合理。而且我看還有很多蠻有意思的拉麵可以嘗嘗看，之後還會再來個一兩次吧。",null,[0,23]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1115254202044787462/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTYTJGNlVUUlViSEJoWVcxbmRFOVhOV3RoTUd4d1ZVZHNRMWd4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1115254202044787462/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTYTJGNlVUUlViSEJoWVcxbmRFOVhOV3RoTUd4d1ZVZHNRMWd4UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1115254202044787462/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTYTJGNlVUUlViSEJoWVcxbmRFOVhOV3RoTUd4d1ZVZHNRMWd4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1115254202044787462/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTYTJGNlVUUlViSEJoWVcxbmRFOVhOV3RoTUd4d1ZVZHNRMWd4UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1115254202044787462/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTYTJGNlVUUlViSEJoWVcxbmRFOVhOV3RoTUd4d1ZVZHNRMWd4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1115254202044787462/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVTYTJGNlVUUlViSEJoWVcxbmRFOVhOV3RoTUd4d1ZVZHNRMWd4UlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,3541,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Sa2F6UTRUbHBhYW1ndE9XNWthMGxwVUdsQ1gxRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xe65d8ebc9c1a70c8!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnRkazQ4Tlp